# The Analyze screen's Components analysis: each part's normal force, CP and drag at one condition, then the total.
# Run with the example rocket loaded: `cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/components.drive out/components`
viewport 1300x800
click "Analyze"
click "Components"
move (100, 700)
move (102, 702)
screenshot components.png
